<section class="sec" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="intro rv"><h2 class="h2">We give you the AI. You bring the judgment.</h2><p class="lede">Run it like a fund: pick your analysts, hear their pitches, and weigh every idea from both sides.</p></div></div><div class="fcar rv"><div class="fcar-track"><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Good judgment is small data</h3><p>Investing has no right answer for AI to find: ask a model what a stock is worth and you get the consensus, which is already in the price. To paraphrase Galileo, reasoning is like racing, not hauling: one thoroughbred outruns a hundred farm horses.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd1_good_judgment.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Good judgment is small data" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1135;height:auto" width="2000" height="1135" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Pick your analysts</h3><p>Olives reward reasoning that holds up, not luck or hype, and they’re earned asset by asset. Use them as a starting point, then build your bench using your own judgment.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd2_leaderboard.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Pick your analysts" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1138;height:auto" width="2000" height="1138" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>Chair your investment committee</h3><p>Your analysts pitch you their best ideas, with the reasoning behind them, and alert you when they rethink a Value. You make the call.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd3_views.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: Chair your investment committee" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1144;height:auto" width="2000" height="1144" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article><article class="fcard"><div class="ftext"><h3>John Maven AI, at your service</h3><p>He covers every asset no analyst has claimed yet. Ask him where analysts stand on an asset, or what’s being said about it on X.</p></div><div class="appwin"><img src="/images/v2/jd4_john_maven.webp" alt="Delphi One app screenshot: John Maven AI, at your service" class="shot" style="aspect-ratio:2000/1140;height:auto" width="2000" height="1140" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></article></div>
